  "notes": [
    "Modbus TCP, SunSpec profile. The inverters are addressed by unit ID: 126 to 168 for STP60 / SHP75 1 to 43; the gateway answers at unit ID 125. Registers are the same for each unit ID.",
    "Register numbers of the manual (40001 = SunSpec ID) are listed as protocol addresses, 40000 for the first (address_base 0).",
    "Values are integers with SunSpec scale factors: each value points to its scale factor register (scale_factor); the manual states the fixed values of the factors.",
    "Only section 5.3 (inverter) is in this map. The gateway (unit ID 125), the Sunny Tripower Storage 60 control interface, the direct marketer and manual restart interfaces are not.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's document; not tested on a device."
  ],
